Christian Bible Study Reading List — 15 Books
Stage 1: Learn How to Read and Interpret the Bible
Months 1–3 | Beginner
1. How to Read the Bible for All Its Worth — Gordon D. Fee & Douglas Stuart
2. The Bible in 90 Minutes — Steve King
3. How to Read the Bible Book by Book — Gordon D. Fee & Douglas Stuart
Stage 2: Understand the Old Testament
Months 4–7 | Beginner to Intermediate
4. The Epic of Eden — Sandra L. Richter
5. The Drama of Scripture — Craig G. Bartholomew & Michael W. Goheen
6. How to Read Proverbs — Tremper Longman III
Stage 3: Understand Jesus and the New Testament
Months 8–12 | Intermediate
7. The New Testament in Its World — N. T. Wright & Michael F. Bird
8. Simply Jesus — N. T. Wright
9. The King Jesus Gospel — Scot McKnight
10. Paul for Everyone: Romans, Part One — N. T. Wright
Stage 4: Connect the Whole Bible and Develop Deeper Understanding
Months 13–18 | Intermediate
11. Paul for Everyone: Romans, Part Two — N. T. Wright
12. Acts for Everyone, Part One — N. T. Wright
13. The Bible Jesus Read — Philip Yancey
14. Reading Scripture with the Church Fathers — Christopher A. Hall
15. Revelation for Everyone — N. T. Wright
